#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:4
msgid "v5.0.0"
msgstr "v5.0.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.0.0 is a major release. It introduces the **OpenMV Viewer** — a separate,"
" read-only build for showing off a finished product — a new **OpenMV Cam "
"Settings Editor**, the **v2 camera debug protocol** for v5.0.0 cameras, and "
"a large set of editor, terminal, firmware, and machine-vision workflow "
"improvements. It is built on Qt Creator 14.0.2."
msgstr ""
"v5.0.0 ist ein Major-Release. Es führt den **OpenMV Viewer** ein — einen "
"separaten, schreibgeschützten Build zum Vorführen eines fertigen Produkts —,"
" einen neuen **OpenMV Cam Settings Editor**, das **v2 Kamera-Debug-"
"Protokoll** für v5.0.0 Kameras sowie eine große Reihe von Verbesserungen an "
"Editor-, Terminal-, Firmware- und Machine-Vision-Arbeitsabläufen. Es basiert"
" auf Qt Creator 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:12
msgid ""
"The version jump to 5.0.0 marks the arrival of the v5.0.0 camera generation "
"and the tooling that supports it; existing v4 projects and workflows "
"continue to work unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Der Versionssprung auf 5.0.0 markiert das Erscheinen der v5.0.0 "
"Kamerageneration und der zugehörigen Werkzeuge; bestehende v4-Projekte und "
"Arbeitsabläufe funktionieren unverändert weiter."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:19
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Auf dieser Seite"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:22
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Highlights"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Viewer** — a new, separately installed build variant that runs the "
"IDE as a locked-down, read-only telemetry viewer. It shows the camera's "
"frame buffer, serial terminal, and histogram and can run a fixed script, but"
" hides the authoring, AI/model, and settings tools, so a customer can "
"demonstrate a product built on OpenMV without the full development "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Viewer** — eine neue, separat installierte Build-Variante, die die "
"IDE als abgeschottete, schreibgeschützte Telemetrie-Ansicht ausführt. Sie "
"zeigt den Frame Buffer, das serielle Terminal und das Histogramm der Kamera "
"und kann ein festes Skript ausführen, verbirgt aber die Authoring-, "
"KI-/Modell- und Einstellungswerkzeuge, sodass ein Kunde ein auf OpenMV "
"basierendes Produkt ohne die vollständige Entwicklungsumgebung vorführen "
"kann."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam Settings Editor** — a graphical editor for the camera's on-"
"board settings configuration file, so you can view and change board settings"
" from a form instead of hand-editing the file."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam Settings Editor** — ein grafischer Editor für die on-board "
"Einstellungs-Konfigurationsdatei der Kamera, sodass Sie Board-Einstellungen "
"über ein Formular ansehen und ändern können, statt die Datei von Hand zu "
"bearbeiten."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**v2 camera debug protocol** — v5.0.0 cameras use a new, more robust debug "
"protocol with header CRC validation, sequence-gap recovery, and a split "
"frame-rate display that reports the on-camera FPS and the IDE display FPS "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"**v2 Kamera-Debug-Protokoll** — v5.0.0 Kameras verwenden ein neues, "
"robusteres Debug-Protokoll mit Header-CRC-Validierung, Wiederherstellung bei"
" Sequenzlücken und einer geteilten Bildratenanzeige, die die FPS an der "
"Kamera und die Anzeige-FPS der IDE getrennt ausweist."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Load Custom Firmware from a .zip** — the firmware installer now accepts a "
"board's build-output ``.zip`` bundle directly, making it easy to flash a "
"custom or locally built firmware image."
msgstr ""
"**Benutzerdefinierte Firmware aus einer .zip laden** — der Firmware-"
"Installer akzeptiert jetzt direkt das ``.zip``-Bundle der Build-Ausgabe "
"eines Boards, wodurch sich ein benutzerdefiniertes oder lokal erstelltes "
"Firmware-Image einfach flashen lässt."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Serial Terminal protocol debug logging** — a toggle in the Serial Terminal"
" logs the camera debug protocol with readable, emoji-tagged lines for "
"diagnosing connection issues."
msgstr ""
"**Protokoll-Debug-Logging im seriellen Terminal** — ein Schalter im "
"seriellen Terminal protokolliert das Kamera-Debug-Protokoll mit lesbaren, "
"emoji-markierten Zeilen zur Diagnose von Verbindungsproblemen."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Reworked Help menu and in-editor docs** — an **OpenMV Docs** submenu "
"replaces the old flat links, ``F1`` opens the documentation for the Python "
"symbol under the cursor, hovering an API name shows its documentation "
"inline, and the About dialog was modernized."
msgstr ""
"**Überarbeitetes Hilfemenü und Dokumentation im Editor** — ein Untermenü "
"**OpenMV Docs** ersetzt die alten flachen Links, ``F1`` öffnet die "
"Dokumentation für das Python-Symbol unter dem Cursor, das Überfahren eines "
"API-Namens zeigt dessen Dokumentation inline an, und der Info-Dialog wurde "
"modernisiert."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:48
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Neue Funktionen"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Viewer build variant.** A forced-viewer-mode build, branded and "
"installed as *OpenMV Viewer*, with its own executable id, settings store, "
"and bundle id so it coexists with the full IDE. It presents as a read-only "
"telemetry viewer: Run/Stop and stop-on-connect work and run a script from "
"disk (via ``-auto_run``), File/Edit menus and Preferences remain, and "
"firmware/ROMFS recovery is kept, while authoring tools, developer machine "
"vision tools, developer settings categories, and AI/model/docs resources are"
" stripped from the build and UI. ROMFS becomes load-only and is promoted to "
"the Tools menu, and firmware-update completion dialogs are genericized "
"(`07722e78a8b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/07722e78a8b>`__, "
"`5cd12ee260e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5cd12ee260e>`__, "
"`b97bf5447e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b97bf5447e4>`__, "
"`952b86de391 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/952b86de391>`__, "
"`1103f7988ed <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1103f7988ed>`__, "
"`f0f60261485 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f0f60261485>`__, "
"`c743d5d67b9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c743d5d67b9>`__, "
"`b4bcdc2d71a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b4bcdc2d71a>`__, "
"`a37c032b6ff <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a37c032b6ff>`__, "
"`480e5668d29 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/480e5668d29>`__, "
"`11c064cac93 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/11c064cac93>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Viewer Build-Variante.** Ein Build im erzwungenen Viewer-Modus, "
"unter dem Namen *OpenMV Viewer* gebrandet und installiert, mit eigener "
"Executable-ID, eigenem Einstellungsspeicher und eigener Bundle-ID, sodass er"
" neben der vollständigen IDE koexistiert. Er präsentiert sich als "
"schreibgeschützte Telemetrie-Ansicht: Run/Stop und Stop-on-Connect "
"funktionieren und führen ein Skript von der Festplatte aus (über "
"``-auto_run``), die Menüs File/Edit und die Preferences bleiben erhalten, "
"und die Firmware-/ROMFS-Wiederherstellung bleibt bestehen, während "
"Authoring-Werkzeuge, Entwickler-Machine-Vision-Werkzeuge, Entwickler-"
"Einstellungskategorien und KI-/Modell-/Dokumentationsressourcen aus Build "
"und UI entfernt werden. ROMFS wird nur-laden und in das Tools-Menü "
"verschoben, und die Abschlussdialoge des Firmware-Updates werden generisch "
"gehalten (`07722e78a8b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/07722e78a8b>`__, `5cd12ee260e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5cd12ee260e>`__, `b97bf5447e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b97bf5447e4>`__, `952b86de391 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/952b86de391>`__, `1103f7988ed <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1103f7988ed>`__, `f0f60261485 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f0f60261485>`__, `c743d5d67b9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c743d5d67b9>`__, `b4bcdc2d71a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b4bcdc2d71a>`__, `a37c032b6ff <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a37c032b6ff>`__, `480e5668d29 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/480e5668d29>`__, `11c064cac93 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/11c064cac93>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:70
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam Settings Editor** — a GUI editor for the camera's settings "
"configuration file, opened from the Tools menu (issue #205) (`f55a0d7fa58 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f55a0d7fa58>`__, `2d7f80b03cf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2d7f80b03cf>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam Settings Editor** — ein GUI-Editor für die Einstellungs-"
"Konfigurationsdatei der Kamera, geöffnet über das Tools-Menü (Issue #205) "
"(`f55a0d7fa58 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f55a0d7fa58>`__, "
"`2d7f80b03cf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2d7f80b03cf>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"**v2 camera debug protocol** for v5.0.0 cameras, with header-CRC validation "
"before any header field is trusted, sequence-gap recovery that rolls forward"
" over dropped packets instead of stalling, and a frame-rate readout split "
"into the on-camera rate and the IDE display rate (`c377bdbaea8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c377bdbaea8>`__, `a3f0488ddcb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a3f0488ddcb>`__, `29108dd40f7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/29108dd40f7>`__, `c15e6c02789 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c15e6c02789>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**v2 Kamera-Debug-Protokoll** für v5.0.0 Kameras, mit Header-CRC-"
"Validierung, bevor einem Header-Feld vertraut wird, Wiederherstellung bei "
"Sequenzlücken, die über verlorene Pakete hinweg vorwärts rollt, statt zu "
"stocken, und einer Bildraten-Anzeige, die in die Rate an der Kamera und die "
"Anzeige-Rate der IDE aufgeteilt ist (`c377bdbaea8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c377bdbaea8>`__, `a3f0488ddcb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a3f0488ddcb>`__, `29108dd40f7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/29108dd40f7>`__, `c15e6c02789 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c15e6c02789>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Load Custom Firmware accepts a .zip bundle** — pick a board's build-output"
" zip and the IDE flashes the firmware (and ROMFS) it contains (`55e4eb2d900 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55e4eb2d900>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Benutzerdefinierte Firmware laden akzeptiert ein .zip-Bundle** — wählen "
"Sie die Build-Ausgabe-Zip eines Boards, und die IDE flasht die darin "
"enthaltene Firmware (und ROMFS) (`55e4eb2d900 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/55e4eb2d900>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:85
msgid ""
"**Serial Terminal debug logging** — a button toggles tiered debug logging of"
" the camera protocol, with each line emoji-tagged and rendered in the emoji "
"font for readability (`09990c62810 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/09990c62810>`__, `42e23c3c11e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/42e23c3c11e>`__, `997705548c7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/997705548c7>`__, `d2208de77d4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d2208de77d4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Debug-Logging im seriellen Terminal** — eine Schaltfläche schaltet ein "
"gestuftes Debug-Logging des Kameraprotokolls um, wobei jede Zeile emoji-"
"markiert und zur besseren Lesbarkeit in der Emoji-Schriftart gerendert wird "
"(`09990c62810 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/09990c62810>`__, "
"`42e23c3c11e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/42e23c3c11e>`__, "
"`997705548c7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/997705548c7>`__, "
"`d2208de77d4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d2208de77d4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Copy/Convert Current Script** — a Tools action that copies or converts the"
" current script, with a guard against saving a compiled "
"``main.py``/``boot.py`` (`81a954f33cd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/81a954f33cd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Aktuelles Skript kopieren/konvertieren** — eine Tools-Aktion, die das "
"aktuelle Skript kopiert oder konvertiert, mit einem Schutz gegen das "
"Speichern einer kompilierten ``main.py``/``boot.py`` (`81a954f33cd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/81a954f33cd>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:95
msgid ""
"**F1 documentation help** on the Python symbol under the cursor, sharing the"
" symbol resolver with the hover tooltips (`c341330bc16 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c341330bc16>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**F1-Dokumentationshilfe** für das Python-Symbol unter dem Cursor, die den "
"Symbol-Resolver mit den Hover-Tooltips teilt (`c341330bc16 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c341330bc16>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"**In-editor documentation tooltips** — hovering an OpenMV API name shows its"
" documentation inline, resolved from the shipped ``.pyi`` stubs and the "
"module's own docs, so you can read what a function, method, constant, or "
"module does without leaving your script (`7ebde92d2a6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7ebde92d2a6>`__, `f225824ba13 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f225824ba13>`__, `59ad01a364a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/59ad01a364a>`__, `02c1e61a2a6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/02c1e61a2a6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Dokumentations-Tooltips im Editor** — wenn Sie mit dem Mauszeiger über "
"einen OpenMV-API-Namen fahren, wird dessen Dokumentation inline angezeigt, "
"aufgelöst aus den mitgelieferten ``.pyi``-Stubs und der eigenen "
"Dokumentation des Moduls, sodass Sie nachlesen können, was eine Funktion, "
"Methode, Konstante oder ein Modul tut, ohne Ihr Skript zu verlassen "
"(`7ebde92d2a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7ebde92d2a6>`__, "
"`f225824ba13 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f225824ba13>`__, "
"`59ad01a364a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/59ad01a364a>`__, "
"`02c1e61a2a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/02c1e61a2a6>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Name a camera** — an IDE-local alias you can give a connected camera, "
"shown in place of the serial port name so identical cameras are tellable "
"apart (`c600158ca34 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c600158ca34>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Kamera benennen** — ein IDE-lokaler Alias, den Sie einer verbundenen "
"Kamera geben können, anstelle des Namens des seriellen Ports angezeigt, "
"sodass sich identische Kameras unterscheiden lassen (`c600158ca34 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c600158ca34>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Keyboard Shortcuts page** — the Preferences shortcuts page is now shown "
"and filtered to the actions you can actually reach, with clearer sourcing "
"and layout (`4f5eae52e8e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4f5eae52e8e>`__, `2d472fe5b40 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2d472fe5b40>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Tastenkürzel-Seite** — die Tastenkürzel-Seite in den Preferences wird "
"jetzt angezeigt und auf die tatsächlich erreichbaren Aktionen gefiltert, mit"
" klarerer Herkunft und Anordnung (`4f5eae52e8e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4f5eae52e8e>`__, `2d472fe5b40 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2d472fe5b40>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:116
msgid "Editor, terminal, and UI improvements"
msgstr "Verbesserungen an Editor, Terminal und UI"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Help menu restructured** into an **OpenMV Docs** submenu (dropping the old"
" flat pinout links), with release-notes links added to the official-release "
"version paths (`e1337ff67c4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e1337ff67c4>`__, `9eacc0994e6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9eacc0994e6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Hilfemenü umstrukturiert** in ein Untermenü **OpenMV Docs** (unter Wegfall"
" der alten flachen Pinout-Links), mit Release-Notes-Links, die den "
"Versionspfaden offizieller Releases hinzugefügt wurden (`e1337ff67c4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e1337ff67c4>`__, `9eacc0994e6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9eacc0994e6>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:123
msgid ""
"**About dialog modernized** — automatic copyright year, a partner-logo "
"table, and a single-line release-notes link (`d89fb74138d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89fb74138d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Info-Dialog modernisiert** — automatisches Copyright-Jahr, eine Partner-"
"Logo-Tabelle und ein einzeiliger Release-Notes-Link (`d89fb74138d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89fb74138d>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Frame Buffer panel** now shows the resolution readout and a frame-buffer "
"mode label beside the fixed JPG button; the mode label is greyed so it does "
"not look clickable (`cb735f82337 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cb735f82337>`__, `376b17d4e77 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/376b17d4e77>`__, `39c6ffc3b26 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/39c6ffc3b26>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Das Frame-Buffer-Panel** zeigt jetzt die Auflösungsanzeige und ein Frame-"
"Buffer-Modus-Label neben der festen JPG-Schaltfläche; das Modus-Label ist "
"ausgegraut, damit es nicht anklickbar wirkt (`cb735f82337 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cb735f82337>`__, `376b17d4e77 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/376b17d4e77>`__, `39c6ffc3b26 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/39c6ffc3b26>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Histogram pane** plots are spline-smoothed, the pane can compress (eliding"
" labels and squishable plots), and the channel label sits beside the stats "
"(`327324ef7e9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/327324ef7e9>`__, "
"`9f8c7035483 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9f8c7035483>`__, "
"`d204e93d5e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d204e93d5e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Histogramm-Bereich**: Die Plots sind Spline-geglättet, der Bereich kann "
"komprimieren (Labels werden ausgelassen und Plots stauchbar), und das Kanal-"
"Label sitzt neben den Statistiken (`327324ef7e9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/327324ef7e9>`__, `9f8c7035483 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9f8c7035483>`__, `d204e93d5e4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d204e93d5e4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Coupled panel dividers** — Ctrl/Cmd-dragging a divider moves the "
"editor/terminal and frame-buffer/histogram splitters together, and the mini-"
"splitter handles get a hover halo with a wider grab area (`379dee250d6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/379dee250d6>`__, `96b83984342 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/96b83984342>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Gekoppelte Panel-Trenner** — das Ziehen eines Trenners mit Strg/Cmd bewegt"
" die Editor-/Terminal- und Frame-Buffer-/Histogramm-Splitter gemeinsam, und "
"die Mini-Splitter-Griffe erhalten einen Hover-Halo mit einem breiteren "
"Greifbereich (`379dee250d6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/379dee250d6>`__, `96b83984342 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/96b83984342>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:142
msgid ""
"**Serial Terminal** — auto-scroll is no longer re-pinned on every output "
"chunk, so scrolling up during fast output stays put; the terminal can run a "
"file from disk when there is no editor (`af67a076e95 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/af67a076e95>`__, `bc132aef536 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bc132aef536>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Serielles Terminal** — das automatische Scrollen wird nicht mehr bei jedem"
" Ausgabe-Chunk neu fixiert, sodass das Hochscrollen bei schneller Ausgabe "
"erhalten bleibt; das Terminal kann eine Datei von der Festplatte ausführen, "
"wenn kein Editor vorhanden ist (`af67a076e95 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/af67a076e95>`__, `bc132aef536 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bc132aef536>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:147
msgid ""
"**Docs commands** are named by page instead of by index (`a3201e9a4b4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a3201e9a4b4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Docs-Befehle** werden nach Seite statt nach Index benannt (`a3201e9a4b4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a3201e9a4b4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:149
msgid ""
"**High-DPI / fractional scaling** — icons, overlays, and the splash screen "
"render correctly at fractional scale factors (125%, 150%, and the like), and"
" the main window remembers its geometry and screen across restarts on multi-"
"monitor setups (`c60711e4950 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c60711e4950>`__, `60901b6e13f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/60901b6e13f>`__, `f241d2ea8ce <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f241d2ea8ce>`__, `54a1bc31fbd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/54a1bc31fbd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**High-DPI / fraktionale Skalierung** — Symbole, Overlays und der Splash-"
"Screen werden bei fraktionalen Skalierungsfaktoren (125 %, 150 % und "
"Ähnlichem) korrekt gerendert, und das Hauptfenster merkt sich seine "
"Geometrie und seinen Bildschirm über Neustarts hinweg bei Multi-Monitor-"
"Konfigurationen (`c60711e4950 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c60711e4950>`__, `60901b6e13f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/60901b6e13f>`__, `f241d2ea8ce <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f241d2ea8ce>`__, `54a1bc31fbd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/54a1bc31fbd>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:159
msgid "Firmware, boards, and tools"
msgstr "Firmware, Boards und Werkzeuge"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:161
msgid ""
"**A board can pin its last-shipped firmware version**, so a board that no "
"longer receives newer firmware is not flagged out of date (`bd987d32f42 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bd987d32f42>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Ein Board kann seine zuletzt ausgelieferte Firmware-Version fixieren**, "
"sodass ein Board, das keine neuere Firmware mehr erhält, nicht als veraltet "
"markiert wird (`bd987d32f42 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bd987d32f42>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:164
msgid ""
"**Out-of-date firmware** status text is now colored red to stand out "
"(`9b18d96bac5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9b18d96bac5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Veraltete Firmware**: Der Statustext ist jetzt rot eingefärbt, um "
"hervorzustechen (`9b18d96bac5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9b18d96bac5>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:166
msgid ""
"**Bootloader-recovery hint** — a ``bootloader.bin`` mismatch now hints at "
"entering bootloader recovery mode (`d46b998c76e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d46b998c76e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Hinweis zur Bootloader-Wiederherstellung** — eine Abweichung bei "
"``bootloader.bin`` weist jetzt darauf hin, in den Bootloader-"
"Wiederherstellungsmodus zu wechseln (`d46b998c76e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d46b998c76e>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:169
msgid ""
"**Video playback** is more robust: the FFmpeg path is surfaced when tools "
"can't launch it, the message is clearer when an architecture doesn't support"
" playback, input formats are queried with ``ffmpeg -demuxers``, and Linux "
"terminal fallbacks were added (`0cc0e74a438 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0cc0e74a438>`__, `a75ec4898d0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a75ec4898d0>`__, `28e1ef10326 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/28e1ef10326>`__, `51651780723 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/51651780723>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Videowiedergabe** ist robuster: Der FFmpeg-Pfad wird angezeigt, wenn "
"Werkzeuge ihn nicht starten können, die Meldung ist klarer, wenn eine "
"Architektur keine Wiedergabe unterstützt, Eingabeformate werden mit ``ffmpeg"
" -demuxers`` abgefragt, und Linux-Terminal-Fallbacks wurden hinzugefügt "
"(`0cc0e74a438 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0cc0e74a438>`__, "
"`a75ec4898d0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a75ec4898d0>`__, "
"`28e1ef10326 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/28e1ef10326>`__, "
"`51651780723 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/51651780723>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:177
msgid ""
"**Dataset Capture Script** updated to the ``csi`` module (`41a781651e4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/41a781651e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Dataset-Capture-Skript** auf das ``csi``-Modul aktualisiert (`41a781651e4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/41a781651e4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:179
msgid ""
"**Windows installer** wizard appearance improved (`250599d9d9e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/250599d9d9e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Windows-Installer**: Das Erscheinungsbild des Assistenten wurde verbessert"
" (`250599d9d9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/250599d9d9e>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:183
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Fehlerbehebungen"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:185
msgid ""
"**Development-firmware install** for ``.lst`` boards (AE3) now stages the "
"binaries the listing references into the flash directory, and the dev/custom"
" install stages the bundle's ROMFS image while clearing any stale "
"``romfs*.img`` first, so the downloaded ROMFS is flashed instead of a "
"leftover editor dump (`3cf56e98668 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3cf56e98668>`__, `43bedc8c591 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/43bedc8c591>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Installation von Entwicklungs-Firmware** für ``.lst``-Boards (AE3) legt "
"jetzt die in der Auflistung referenzierten Binärdateien im Flash-Verzeichnis"
" ab, und die Dev-/Custom-Installation legt das ROMFS-Image des Bundles ab, "
"wobei zuvor jede veraltete ``romfs*.img`` entfernt wird, sodass das "
"heruntergeladene ROMFS geflasht wird statt eines übrig gebliebenen Editor-"
"Dumps (`3cf56e98668 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3cf56e98668>`__, `43bedc8c591 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/43bedc8c591>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:192
msgid ""
"**libjpeg warnings** for truncated/corrupt frames are filtered out of the "
"log so a lossy stream doesn't spam the terminal (`6e2a8bed6cf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6e2a8bed6cf>`__, `a5166abbdc1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a5166abbdc1>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**libjpeg-Warnungen** für abgeschnittene/beschädigte Frames werden aus dem "
"Log herausgefiltert, sodass ein verlustbehafteter Stream das Terminal nicht "
"zuspammt (`6e2a8bed6cf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6e2a8bed6cf>`__, `a5166abbdc1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a5166abbdc1>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:196
msgid ""
"The examples list no longer shows the internal ``index.json`` (`14ac8ca48a7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/14ac8ca48a7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Die Beispielliste zeigt die interne ``index.json`` nicht mehr an "
"(`14ac8ca48a7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/14ac8ca48a7>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:198
msgid ""
"Firmware-upgrade and onboarding pop-ups are suppressed in viewer mode so a "
"product demo never prompts to overwrite the customer's firmware "
"(`7b8528c3ad6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7b8528c3ad6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Firmware-Upgrade- und Onboarding-Pop-ups werden im Viewer-Modus unterdrückt,"
" sodass eine Produktdemo niemals auffordert, die Firmware des Kunden zu "
"überschreiben (`7b8528c3ad6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7b8528c3ad6>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:201
msgid ""
"Dangling and authoring-only keyboard shortcuts left over from stripped menus"
" were disabled (`be3bee8bb58 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/be3bee8bb58>`__, `27d1afc8705 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/27d1afc8705>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Verwaiste und nur zum Authoring gehörende Tastenkürzel, die von entfernten "
"Menüs übrig geblieben waren, wurden deaktiviert (`be3bee8bb58 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be3bee8bb58>`__, `27d1afc8705 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/27d1afc8705>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:207
msgid "Localization"
msgstr "Lokalisierung"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:209
msgid ""
"**Four new languages** — Indonesian, Romanian, Thai, and Vietnamese — "
"bringing the IDE to 37 translated languages, and every catalog was updated, "
"translated, and cleaned across all languages (`fcf04090843 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/fcf04090843>`__, `c830e6c4de3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c830e6c4de3>`__, `5e22679923f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5e22679923f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Vier neue Sprachen** — Indonesisch, Rumänisch, Thailändisch und "
"Vietnamesisch — womit die IDE 37 übersetzte Sprachen erreicht, und jeder "
"Katalog wurde über alle Sprachen hinweg aktualisiert, übersetzt und "
"bereinigt (`fcf04090843 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/fcf04090843>`__, `c830e6c4de3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c830e6c4de3>`__, `5e22679923f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5e22679923f>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:217
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Befehlszeile"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:219
msgid ""
"**GNU-style ``--word`` option aliases** are now accepted alongside the "
"single-dash forms, and the ``-help`` output notes the equivalence "
"(`66414213dd9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/66414213dd9>`__, "
"`768c5d0e159 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/768c5d0e159>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Optionsaliase im GNU-Stil ``--word``** werden jetzt neben den Formen mit "
"einem einzelnen Bindestrich akzeptiert, und die ``-help``-Ausgabe weist auf "
"die Gleichwertigkeit hin (`66414213dd9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/66414213dd9>`__, `768c5d0e159 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/768c5d0e159>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:225
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Plattform- und Tool-Unterstützung"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:227
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator Basis:** 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:228
msgid "**OpenMV IDE** version bumped to 5.0.0."
msgstr "**OpenMV IDE** Version auf 5.0.0 angehoben."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:229
msgid "**New:** the separately installed **OpenMV Viewer** build variant."
msgstr "**Neu:** die separat installierte Build-Variante **OpenMV Viewer**."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"**Python 3.14** support — the bundled ``parso`` parser was updated to 0.8.7,"
" keeping code completion and the language server working with the latest "
"Python syntax (`578a4e39d97 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/578a4e39d97>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Unterstützung für **Python 3.14** — der mitgelieferte ``parso``-Parser wurde"
" auf 0.8.7 aktualisiert, wodurch Code-Vervollständigung und Language-Server "
"mit der neuesten Python-Syntax funktionieren (`578a4e39d97 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/578a4e39d97>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:236
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.0.0.rst:238
msgid ""
"None for existing projects. The v2 debug protocol applies to v5.0.0 cameras;"
" v4-generation cameras continue to use the existing protocol, and existing "
"scripts and workflows are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Keine für bestehende Projekte. Das v2-Debug-Protokoll gilt für v5.0.0 "
"Kameras; Kameras der v4-Generation verwenden weiterhin das bestehende "
"Protokoll, und bestehende Skripte und Arbeitsabläufe sind nicht betroffen."
